  "Landing gear on a wheel that folds away: the leg swings forward into its bay, the wheel with it.": "Landing gear on a wheel that folds away: the leg swings forward into its bay, the wheel with it.",
  "Ramjet": "Ramjet",
  "Ramjets": "Ramjets",
  "Reversible Rotor": "Reversible Rotor",
  "Solid Rocket Nozzle": "Solid Rocket Nozzle",
  "Solid Rocket Segment": "Solid Rocket Segment",
  "Solid Rockets": "Solid Rockets",
  "Solid propellant for a solid rocket motor. Stack segments of the same size straight on top of a solid rocket nozzle; a segment that is not in such a stack does nothing. Each one adds about 8 s of burn and gets lighter as it burns. It cannot be refilled.": "Solid propellant for a solid rocket motor. Stack segments of the same size straight on top of a solid rocket nozzle; a segment that is not in such a stack does nothing. Each one adds about 8 s of burn and gets lighter as it burns. It cannot be refilled.",
  "Supersonic air-breather that burns hydrogen: no static thrust, needs a boost past ~Mach 0.5, best at Mach 3-4, fades by Mach 6. Draws hydrogen through conveyors like a hydrogen thruster. Air only.": "Supersonic air-breather that burns hydrogen: no static thrust, needs a boost past ~Mach 0.5, best at Mach 3-4, fades by Mach 6. Draws hydrogen through conveyors like a hydrogen thruster. Air only.",
  "The nozzle of a solid rocket motor: the segments of its size stacked on its top face are its propellant. Ignite it from its terminal or a toolbar: it burns at full thrust until the stack is empty and cannot be throttled or shut down. Your thrusters, dampeners and flight controller never use it. Works in air and in space (about 10 % stronger in vacuum).": "The nozzle of a solid rocket motor: the segments of its size stacked on its top face are its propellant. Ignite it from its terminal or a toolbar: it burns at full thrust until the stack is empty and cannot be throttled or shut down. Your thrusters, dampeners and flight controller never use it. Works in air and in space (about 10 % stronger in vacuum).",
  "Turboprop": "Turboprop",
  "Turboprops": "Turboprops",
  "Two leaves that split open to brake in the air - with the parking brake (P).": "Two leaves that split open to brake in the air - with the parking brake (P).",
  "Wheeled Landing Gear": "Wheeled Landing Gear",
  "AeroModTexts_Probe": "Aerodynamics Mod",
  "Flies its ship for you: hover, hold a height, cruise, follow a GPS route or another ship, return home, or attack a target. Set it in its control panel.": "Flies its ship for you: hover, hold a height, cruise, follow a GPS route or another ship, return home, or attack a target. Set it in its control panel."
}